2000.Cited_mul_comm`]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">## Description</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">A complete proof modulo the single unproved cited arithmetic result.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">namespace</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Fixture2000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/-- **Theorem 4** (Fixture2000). Specialize the cited commutativity law to the degree. -/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">theorem</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> degree_mul_comm</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (c : ChainComplexToy) (n : Nat) : c.degree * n = n * c.degree :=</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  cited_mul_comm c.degree n</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">end</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Fixture2000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span></code></pre>",
    "source_text": "import HomAlg.Fixture2000.Def_1\nimport HomAlg.Fixture2000.Cited_mul_comm\n\n/-!\n```yaml node\n{\n  \"id\": \"Fixture2000.Thm_4\",\n  \"kind\": \"theorem\",\n  \"doc\": \"Fixture2000\",\n  \"source\": {\n    \"chapter\": \"1\",\n    \"section\": \"1.1\",\n    \"label\": \"Theorem 4\",\n    \"pages\": [\n      4\n    ]\n  },\n  \"title\": \"Theorem 4\",\n  \"tags\": [\n    \"chain-complex\",\n    \"basic\"\n  ],\n  \"concepts\": {\n    \"defines\": [],\n    \"uses\": []\n  },\n  \"deps\": {\n    \"statement\": [\n      \"Fixture2000.Def_1\"\n    ],\n    \"proof\": [\n      \"Fixture2000.Cited_mul_comm\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"decls\": [\n    \"Fixture2000.degree_mul_comm\"\n  ],\n  \"fidelity\": {\n    \"status\": \"faithful\"\n  },\n  \"nl_proof_source\": {\n    \"follows\": \"document\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Statement\n\nFor every toy chain complex $C$ and natural number $n$, $(\\deg C)n=n(\\deg C)$.\n\n## Proof\n\nUse the well-known commutativity of multiplication, taking the first factor to be the degree. [uses `Fixture2000.Cited_mul_comm`]\n\n## Description\n\nA complete proof modulo the single unproved cited arithmetic result.\n-/\n\nnamespace Fixture2000\n\n/-- **Theorem 4** (Fixture2000). Specialize the cited commutativity law to the degree. -/\ntheorem degree_mul_comm (c : ChainComplexToy) (n : Nat) : c.degree * n = n * c.degree :=\n  cited_mul_comm c.degree n\n\nend Fixture2000\n"
